===== Inox Teller =====
1 - Balance
2 - Deposit
3 - Withdrawal
4 - Transfer to account 2
5 - Cancel the last operation
6 - Statement
7 - Reload from the file
9 - Reset the accounts
0 - Quit
Option: Accounts reset.

